Article 9 (Transitional measures following amendment to the Enforcement Decree of the Sewerage Act)
(1) The first re-training under the amended provisions of Article 38(2)2a of the Enforcement Decree of the Sewerage Act shall be conducted in the year in which the fifth anniversary from the completion date of the most recent re-training conducted before this Decree enters into force falls.
(2) The amended provisions of Article 38(2)2b of the Enforcement Decree of the Sewerage Act shall begin to apply to the first case where the relevant business is suspended after this Decree enters into force.

